WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.750
<v Instructor>So here is a small lecture</v>

2
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:05.220
on the AWS Cloud Adoption Readiness Tool or CART.

3
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.310
And this is a tool that helps organization develop efficient

4
00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.480
and effective plans for cloud adoption and migrations.

5
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:14.030
So you're going to get a score chart like this.

6
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.610
And the idea is that you want to transform your idea

7
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:18.931
of moving to the cloud into a detailed plan

8
00:00:18.931 --> 00:00:22.860
that will follow the best practices from AWS.

9
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.880
So to do so, you're going to transfer a set

10
00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:27.400
of questions across six different perspectives.

11
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.500
It could be business, people, process, platform,

12
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.080
operations and security.

13
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.170
And then it's going to give you a chart as a result.

14
00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:37.180
And the custom report will give you your level

15
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.200
of migration readiness

16
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.533
and give you some recommendations

17
00:00:39.533 --> 00:00:43.080
to implement the best practices on AWS.

18
00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.770
So it's just a tool you will see at a high level

19
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.290
of the exam, nothing too much to worry about,

20
00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:48.410
but I hope you liked this lecture

21
00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.360
and I will see you in the next lecture.

